{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45538","headline":"乞荆浩画 · 大愚","name":"乞荆浩画","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六幅故牢健，知君恣笔踪。\n不求千涧水，止要两株松。\n树下留盘石，天边纵远峰。\n近岩幽湿处，惟藉墨烟浓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"大愚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}